---
import aboutimg from "../images/about.webp";
---

<section id="about-me" class="flex w-full items-center justify-center py-10">
  <div
    data-aos="fade-up"
    data-aos-anchor-placement="center-bottom"
    class="flex flex-col items-center lg:w-3/5 px-10 py-20 md:p-10 space-y-10 bg-pink-200 rounded-tl-[300px] rounded-br-[300px] bg-opacity-70 max-w-[920px]"
  >
    <h1 class="text-3xl text-pink-500 font-semibold pt-4">About Tipsy Nails</h1>
    <div class="lg:px-[10%] justify-center lg:space-x-8">
      <img
        src={aboutimg.src}
        alt="Tipsy Nails studio"
        class="float-right md:h-64 md:w-60 rounded-full border-4 border-pink-500 shadow-xl shadow-pink-400 lg:mx-5 mb-5"
      />
      <p class="text-gray-600 font-medium text-xl lg:px-5 text-justify">
        Tipsy Nails is a passionate and expert nail studio with over 10 years of
        experience, providing high-quality manicure services from our studio in
        the vibrant heart of Miami. Our dedication to the art of nail care began
        as a personal passion that soon became our profession and the reason we
        strive every day to perfect and update our skills. We firmly believe that
        a good manicure goes beyond aesthetics; it's a form of self-care that
        boosts confidence and well-being. In our studio, each session is an
        opportunity to provide a moment of relaxation and luxury, ensuring that
        every client feels special and valued. We use high-quality products that
        are kind to both the skin and the environment, guaranteeing stunning
        results that speak for themselves. If you're looking for experience,
        creativity, and meticulous attention to detail, we would love the
        opportunity to beautify your hands and make you feel even more
        beautiful. We look forward to welcoming you to our studio soon and
        creating something beautiful together!
      </p>
    </div>
    <div class="flex flex-col items-center">
      <p class="px-5 text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-600">Tipsy Nails</p>
      <span class="px-5 text-gray-500 text-md mb-8">Licensed Nail Studio.</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
